    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action, 3D-Platformer Game About An Aristocratioc Potato Doing parkour</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you play as a potato which does parkour to survive from evil Peelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by collecting pancakes u get higher in level, and the game gets more and more difficult,\u00a0until you meet the <strong>FINAL BOSS,,</strong>\u00a0good luck there :3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478640/extras/17aaec48b736f860e698f2d3ffadf62e.poster.avif?t=1747713865\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478640/extras/17aaec48b736f860e698f2d3ffadf62e.webm?t=1747713865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478640/extras/17aaec48b736f860e698f2d3ffadf62e.mp4?t=1747713865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >low-poly Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hand-drawn animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fun facts about potatoes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Note : this my very first game i develop, design, making audio... it might not be that good but hope u enjoy it :3</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action, 3D-Platformer Game About An Aristocratioc Potato Doing parkour</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you play as a potato which does parkour to survive from evil Peelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by collecting pancakes u get higher in level, and the game gets more and more difficult,\u00a0until you meet the <strong>FINAL BOSS,,</strong>\u00a0good luck there :3 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478640/extras/17aaec48b736f860e698f2d3ffadf62e.poster.avif?t=1747713865\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478640/extras/17aaec48b736f860e698f2d3ffadf62e.webm?t=1747713865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478640/extras/17aaec48b736f860e698f2d3ffadf62e.mp4?t=1747713865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >low-poly Design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hand-drawn animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fun facts about potatoes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Note : this my very first game i develop, design, making audio... it might not be that good but hope u enjoy it :3</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
